note feltPiano
; @pos 0 -48
; A sixteen-voice felt piano
; using 264 mono recordings in
; three concatenated PCM banks.
; Play MIDI input port 0.
; Held keys keep their envelope
; level; note-off releases over
; 100 ms. CC123 releases all notes.
;
; A separate noteEventBuffer
; queues control events, publishing
; one event per audio frame.
; enqueueEvent accepts ON=1,
; OFF=2, ALL_OFF=3, then note
; and velocity. The queue holds
; 128 events and drops new
; arrivals when full.
;
; feltPiano contains the sampler,
; mapper, settings, and PCM banks.
; Its sampler receives mapSample
; and settings via pass.
; Use notes 21-108 and
; velocities 1-127 for note-on.
; Velocities 1-42 select piano,
; 43-84 mezzo, 85-127 forte.
; All three banks load once:
; about 151 MiB of mono signed
; 16-bit little-endian PCM, 48 kHz.
; Wait for asset loading to finish.
;
; @config audioRuntime.enabled true
; @config audioRuntime.sampleRate 48000
; @config audioRuntime.audioOutBufferLAddress audioout:buffer
; @config audioRuntime.audioOutBufferRAddress audioout:buffer
; @config export.fileName feltPiano
noteEnd

