or **allOff
if
loop VOICES
loopIndex
call voiceNoteAddress
load
push **note
equal
and **trigger
or **allOff
if
loopIndex
push &voiceOn
push &voiceOff
push &voiceNote
call selectVoiceControls
push voiceNote
push 0
store
push voiceOff
push 1
store
push voiceOn
push 0
store
ifEnd
